Alembic migrations for the tgobjects3 PostgreSQL index.

The database URL is read from the DATABASE_URL environment variable by env.py
(normalised to the postgresql+asyncpg driver); it is never stored in
alembic.ini. Run migrations with the repository root as the working directory:

    DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/db alembic upgrade head

The gateway also applies `alembic upgrade head` automatically at startup
(Requirement 1.4).
